        Run <code class="code" style="color: var(--green);">CloseMeet-Lite-v1.0-Setup.exe</code> to install directly to <code class="code">%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\CloseMeetLite</code> without administrator (UAC) prompts, or extract the portable archive on any Windows 10/11 x64 machine.
